Package: linux-tools-iceland
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: iceland mainline <iceland@localhost>
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel version specific tools for @KVER@
 perf built from the @KVER@ kernel tree (tools/perf), installed
 under /usr/lib/linux-tools-@KVER@/ following the Ubuntu
 linux-tools-<version> layout.
 .
 postinst creates /usr/bin/perf-@KVER@ and, when no other package
 owns the name (Ubuntu's linux-perf ships /usr/bin/perf as a file),
 /usr/bin/perf pointing at it; prerm removes both links again.
